"Vajra keeps elite Coldguard troops and Immortals, her strongest soldiers, in stasis over winter."
"Vajra's Immortals are giant armored bees whose banners record each unit's battle honors."
"Vajra was once War Queen of a bee empire hundreds of millions strong."
"Vajra's old empire was annihilated by Winged Demons in a war that killed billions."
"Vajra is that empire's last War Queen; she now serves Jin."
"Vajra's original hive-mother queen still lives, commanding a hive loyal to the Emperor."
"After an Ash Forest ritual later this year, Vajra gains a human form."
"In human form Vajra is a mature woman with a hexagon mark on her forehead."
"Vajra will inherit the late Mishu's title, Empress of the Forest, without meaning to."
"As Empress of the Forest Vajra is oath-bound to protect and improve the Ash Forest."
"Vajra's Domain binds to 'home', so planting trees extends it."
"Vajra will have bears and villagers donate a little Qi daily to heal the Ash Forest."
"In human form Vajra can speak through one focused scout bee at 100 times her normal range."
